# Deploy package location

Never copy, write, or unzip deployment files to the Desktop (`C:\Users\lrn\Desktop` or `[Environment]::GetFolderPath("Desktop")`).

Put zips, overlays, SQL packs, and `DEPLOY.txt` under the repo, typically:

`publish/zips/`

Do not use `LabMetricsApplication\Zips_*` or other Desktop-style drop folders unless the user names that path in the request.
